flowchart LR
  subgraph Inputs
    Text
    Images
    Audio
    Video[Video: timed frames and audio]
  end
  Text --> Tok[Tokenizer and embeddings]
  Images --> Vision[SigLip2 vision encoder and resampler]
  Audio --> Encoder[Whisper-medium encoder and projection]
  Video -.-> Vision
  Video -.-> Encoder
  Tok --> Thinker[Thinker: Qwen3-8B prefill and decode]
  Vision --> Thinker
  Encoder --> Thinker
  Thinker --> Words[Text detokenization]
  Thinker -. speech conditioning .-> Talker[Talker: codec tokens]
  Talker -.-> Flow[Flow: acoustic features]
  Reference[Optional reference voice] -.-> Flow
  Flow -.-> HiFT[HiFT: waveform]
  Note[Conceptual model diagram. Dashed routes are task-dependent.]
